### Terraform ###
# Local .terraform directories (provider binaries, modules cache)
**/.terraform/*

# .tfstate files — NEVER commit these. They can contain resource IDs,
# IPs, and in some cases plaintext secrets pulled from data sources.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup

# Crash log files
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Exclude override files, generally used to override resources locally
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Ignore CLI configuration files that may contain tokens
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Ignore variable files that likely contain sensitive data
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!terraform.tfvars.example

# Ignore lock files pinning provider versions (optional — many teams DO
# commit this one for reproducibility; uncomment the next line to ignore it)
# .terraform.lock.hcl

# Ignore transient plan files
*.tfplan
tfplan

### Node.js (app/) ###
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm
.npm-cache/

### Ansible ###
*.retry
*.vault_pass

### AWS / Secrets ###
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
aws-exports.js
credentials
.aws/

### Jenkins ###
jenkins_home/

### OS / Editor ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

### Logs ###
*.log